    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i think something is wrong. i've seen things on my social media feeds that i know i didnt post. not just typos or weird stuff, but actual thoughts and memories that feel like they're being mimicked... i'm starting to think [TechCorp] actually has a digital copy of my consciousness running. can you help me figure out how to spot the gaps between the real me and whatever they've built out of my data?",
