      "content": "When you suspect a simulation, focus on testing the boundaries of your own \"self\" against the online persona. Intentionally introduce concepts or experiences into your real life that you have never discussed digitally to see if the simulation reacts appropriately or misses the mark. Furthermore, external third parties you trust, who have no data access, can serve as a real-world calibration point for your authentic self.",
